  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: e3cf711bd06ef4f479a2906fc1414ca9, type: 3}
  m_Name: Vieja10_en
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::ScriptableObjects.Dialogues.DialoguesData
  language: 1
  dialogues:
  - Be careful <color=#FF00FF>Sonny</color>.
  - <color=#00FFFF>A terrible battle</color> occurred here, The last one my tribe
    ever took part of, the one that ended our fight.
  - <color=yellow>I was just a little girl</color=yellow> when it happened. I tried
    to help, to protect everyone but... That night, death was in the air. And none
    of our Gods came down to help us.
  - I don't remember much about this place, I can't even recall how I left here alive.
    <wave amplitude=2>Perhaps it's better that way, to forget everything.</wave>
